  (text "isolation\nbarrier (U702)"
    (at 196.85 124.46 0)
    (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left bottom))
    (uuid "bce2db37-2b4b-41e3-8545-1eb9408c2ff2")
  )
  (text "Full speed: SPU = SPD = high.  PDEN = VDD1 (normal operation).  24 R +/-1 % on all four data lines.\nUSBLC6 pins 1-6 / 3-4 are flow-through pairs: route D-/D+ across the pads."
    (at 20.32 200.66 0)
    (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left bottom))
    (uuid "11b0e743-2d3f-4243-85d8-a6edfb0ff223")
  )
  (text "USB_CONNECT (PA10) enables the PC-side pull-up only when the USB stack is ready\n(re-enumerate by pulling it low for ~100 ms).  VBUS2 = VDD2 = +3V3 (regulator bypassed).\nLayout: >= 8 mm creepage under U702, no copper on any layer crossing it; 90 Ohm D+/D- pairs."
    (at 226.06 200.66 0)
    (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left bottom))
    (uuid "75d3a968-c820-4e0a-9468-b1135b9a5bea")
  )
